plugin-hostd (0.15.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Release 0.15.1: the LV2 toggle fix (#305)
  * describe: an LV2 toggle stays a toggle whatever order the dump lists its
    records in
  * Keep a quarantined joiner out of a chain and report no survivor running
    during backoff (#167)
  * Release 0.15.1 (#152, #223, #239, #236)
  * Print the ready line only once the command and feedback ports listen
    (#238)
  * docs: the status page in three parts: proven on the Pi, released, open;
    fuzzing and verification
  * Point the record-id sabotage arm at the comparison that now reads it
    (#239)
  * Match a percent-encoded LV2 IRI to its qualification record (#239)
  * describe (LV2): read a port group's path through pg:subGroupOf (#223)
  * docs: state facts against versions and in the present, without dates in
    the pages
  * Answer remote_pages, remote_page_get and param_info of an LV2 instance
    from the bundle's ports (#152)
  * docs: status: the new set on the Pi, the LV2 re-qualification running
    since 23:57 CET
  * docs: status states the release gate and the openmixer fix without links
    into private repositories
  * Read worker_list with the pool field in the Zynthian tools and the bench
    (#236)
  * docs: where the Zynthian work stands, 2026-10-29 night

